>>
endobj
474 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (There is also room to do 4 days a week by removing a Lower Body Session to do Push Pull Legs and a Full Body workout to ensure each muscle group is hit a minimum of twice in a week. If you have a bad week and miss a few sessions, hitting a one push, one pull, one legs, and a Full body is enough to effectively work the entire body.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
475 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (Finally if you wish to workout 6 days a week you can do a PPL PPL. This is two push days, two pull days and two legs days across the week with a days rest.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
476 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
