/P 224 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
477 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (Try to stick to 5 sessions as a baseline most of the time. And if you have a bad week where you only hit 4 sessions, try to make up for it by doing at least one full body session in that week. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
478 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (Alternatively, I usually reccomend missing a Leg day for male clients on a really inconsistent week, as males benefit from targeting their upper body more frequently for aesthetics. So on 4 days a week you could also do a Push Pull Push Pull type split. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
479 0 obj
<<
