/Title (Aim for 70 - 80% adherence to this programme. This means you can reduce the number of sets, miss cardio here and there, and swap out certain styles of cardio for easier ones depending on how you feel. At this stage listening to your body is important. IF you feel tired, if you feel injuries start to build, you have to use your intuition when training at an advanced level.)
